  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Global Health Security: Expanding Efforts and Strategies to Protect and Improve Public Health Globally</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Organization for Migration (IOM) will continue to provide technical and operational assistance to migrants under the Migrant Protection Protocols (MPP) at the points of entry (POE) across the US-Mexico border.  IOM will provide reception of MPPs and in alliance with private clinics that are part of the public health surveillance systems for COVID-19, together will provide test for detection of COVID-19 and medical referral and monitoring.</narrative>
  </description>
